        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "Combo Adept",
          "description": "This unit will immediately get the next turn after using Opening Smash, Knockout Blaster or Dragon Finisher. Then this effect cannot trigger again until 50TU advances.\n\nWhen this unit enters the battlefield, for 100TU this unit:\n- Cannot fall asleep.\n- Has 80% damage reduction from attacks.\n\nThis unit will ignore attacks that would damage exactly 2 targets (attacks that target All allies will not be ignored). If this unit gains the Stealth status effect, it will not be lost when ignoring attacks in this way.\n\nThis unit's attacks will not wake sleeping enemies, and ignore:\n- damage reduction effects.\n- any effects of non-boss enemies that would prevent targets from being defeated.\n- skin passive skills, and the Counter Stance status effect."
        }
      },
      "HoldStrongPassiveAXiaoLiRegularBoss": {
        "id": "HoldStrongPassiveAXiaoLiRegularBoss",
        "found": true,
        "localization": {
          "name": "True Warrior",
          "description": "This unit enters battle with a Stun Ward.\n\nIf this unit would be defeated by an enemy attack or a status effect while having more than 1 HP, it instead survives with 1 HP.\n\nThis unit cannot be sent to the reinforcements from the battlefield, and cannot be defeated by damage from Poison or Burn status effects.\n\nAt the end of each sleeping enemy turn, this unit will have its current TU reduced by 50TU. This TU reduction may trigger before or after other effects that adjust the turn order. If this triggers 5 times within 50TU, this effect cannot trigger again until 50TU advances."
        }
      }
